#. Description of the plugin
#: fgsync-oblio.php
msgid "Invoicing and stock management for WooCommerce through Oblio. Automatic invoices, proformas, delivery notes and credit notes in Oblio, with queued processing and warehouse-based stock sync. Native WooCommerce integration (HPOS + classic orders). Independent integration, not developed or endorsed by Oblio.eu."
msgstr ""

